# Safe Events Component

Domain-specific event types for Safe transaction monitoring and anomaly detection.

## Key Integration Pattern
Each event type represents a specific Safe anomaly (threshold mismatch, signer issues, recovery transaction problems) with structured data for notification formatting.

## Important Constraints
- Events must include Safe address and relevant context (transaction IDs, signer counts, thresholds)
- Test files must verify all notification format methods (text, markdown, HTML)